This folder contains programs that are useful in processing data
used to evaluate SiB4.

====================================================================
The MODIS routines process/modify MODIS LAI data at sites from the 
MODIS Land Produts Subsets product (https://modis.ornl.gov/fixedsite/).

MODIS_laicsv.f90
-----------------
Main routine to process downloaded MODIS site-specific LAI
in a csv file to a netcdf file.

MODIS_laifpar.f90
-----------------
Main routine to process downloaded MODIS site-specific LAI
in an hdf file to a netcdf file.

MODIS_calclai.f90
-----------------
Routine to calculate the annual maximum LAI.

MODIS_maxlai.f90
-----------------
Routine to calculate the mean annual maximum LAI for a list of sites.

MODIS_modlai.pro
----------------
IDL routine to smooth MODIS data, removing large jumps.

MODIS_evglai.pro
-----------------
IDL routine to remove strong seasonal cycle in MODIS 
data at evergreen forest sites.

MODIS_modnc.pro
----------------
IDL routine to modify LAI netcdf files.

====================================================================
The fluxnet routines process/modify fluxes from FluxNet.

fluxnet_csv_to_netcdf.f90
--------------------------
Generic routine to process Fluxnet comma-separated data to netcdf files.

fluxnet_l2nc_to_netcdf.f90
---------------------------
Generic routine to process Fluxnet level-2 netcdf data.

fluxnet15_csv_to_netcdf.f90
----------------------------
Generic routine to process Fluxnet2015 data.


====================================================================
Specific routines for the separate networks in FluxNet.

ameriflux_csv_to_netcdf.f90
----------------------------
Processes comma-separated Ameriflux data into netcdf files.

asiaflux_csv_to_netcdf.f90
--------------------------
Processes comma-separated AsiaFlux data into netcdf files.

caflux_csv_to_netcdf.f90
-------------------------
Processes comma-separated CanadaFlux data into netcdf files.

euflux_csv_to_netcdf.f90
-------------------------
Processes Europian fluxnet data into netcdf files.

lba_csv_to_netcdf.f90
----------------------
Processes LBA fluxnet data into netcdf files.

ozflux_nc_to_netcdf.f90
------------------------
Processes OzFlux data (Australia) into netcdf files.



fluxnet_calcgpp.pro
--------------------
Calculates annual GPP from Fluxnet GPP data.

fluxnet_fixtime.f90
-------------------
Program to fix the time dimension.
Kept as a sample of a fortran program to modify the
netcdf data.

fluxnet_modnc.pro
-----------------
IDL program to modify the netcdf data.


